#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:4
msgid "NSX-T Certificate Management"
msgstr "Gerenciamento de Certificados NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides integrated certificate management for VMware NSX-T "
"environments. NSX-T requires certificates for securing communications "
"between its management plane, control plane, and transport nodes. "
"|morpheus| can manage the lifecycle of these certificates, including "
"uploading certificates to NSX-T managers and associating them with NSX-T "
"services."
msgstr "O |morpheus| fornece gerenciamento integrado de certificados para ambientes VMware NSX-T. O NSX-T exige certificados para proteger as comunicações entre seu plano de gerenciamento, plano de controle e nós de transporte. O |morpheus| pode gerenciar o ciclo de vida desses certificados, incluindo o envio de certificados aos managers NSX-T e a associação deles a serviços NSX-T."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:11
msgid ""
"This feature is available when an NSX-T integration has been configured "
"in |morpheus|."
msgstr "Este recurso está disponível quando uma integração NSX-T foi configurada no |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:14
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:16
msgid ""
"An active NSX-T integration configured in |morpheus| (Infrastructure > "
"Network > Integrations)"
msgstr "Uma integração NSX-T ativa configurada no |morpheus| (Infrastructure > Network > Integrations)"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:17
msgid "NSX-T Manager version 2.5 or higher"
msgstr "NSX-T Manager versão 2.5 ou superior"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:18
msgid "Appropriate NSX-T API permissions for certificate management"
msgstr "Permissões apropriadas da API NSX-T para gerenciamento de certificados"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:19
msgid "Valid SSL/TLS certificates compatible with NSX-T requirements"
msgstr "Certificados SSL/TLS válidos compatíveis com os requisitos do NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:22
msgid "NSX-T Certificate Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos de Certificado NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:24
msgid "NSX-T has specific requirements for certificates:"
msgstr "O NSX-T tem requisitos específicos para certificados:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:26
msgid "**Format:** PEM-encoded X.509 certificates"
msgstr "**Format:** Certificados X.509 codificados em PEM"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:27
msgid "**Key Size:** Minimum 2048-bit RSA or 256-bit ECDSA"
msgstr "**Key Size:** Mínimo RSA de 2048 bits ou ECDSA de 256 bits"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Subject Alternative Names (SANs):** Must include the FQDN and IP "
"address of the NSX-T Manager nodes"
msgstr "**Subject Alternative Names (SANs):** Devem incluir o FQDN e o endereço IP dos nós do NSX-T Manager"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Extended Key Usage:** Server Authentication (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1) and "
"Client Authentication (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.2) as appropriate"
msgstr "**Extended Key Usage:** Server Authentication (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1) e Client Authentication (1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.2) conforme apropriado"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Validity:** Certificates should have sufficient validity period "
"(recommended minimum 1 year)"
msgstr "**Validity:** Os certificados devem ter período de validade suficiente (mínimo recomendado de 1 ano)"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:33
msgid "Managing NSX-T Certificates"
msgstr "Gerenciando Certificados NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:36
msgid "Uploading Certificates to NSX-T"
msgstr "Enviando Certificados para o NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:38
msgid ""
"When a certificate is uploaded to |morpheus| and associated with an NSX-T"
" integration, |morpheus| handles pushing the certificate to the NSX-T "
"Manager:"
msgstr "Quando um certificado é enviado ao |morpheus| e associado a uma integração NSX-T, o |morpheus| cuida de enviar o certificado ao NSX-T Manager:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:40
msgid "Navigate to |InfTruCer|"
msgstr "Navegue até |InfTruCer|"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:41
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:42
msgid "Select the NSX-T certificate type"
msgstr "Selecione o tipo de certificado NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:43
msgid "Complete the certificate fields:"
msgstr "Preencha os campos do certificado:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:45
msgid "**NAME:** Descriptive name for the certificate"
msgstr "**NAME:** Nome descritivo para o certificado"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:46
msgid "**NSX-T INTEGRATION:** Select the target NSX-T integration"
msgstr "**NSX-T INTEGRATION:** Selecione a integração NSX-T de destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:47
msgid "**CERTIFICATE (PEM):** The certificate content"
msgstr "**CERTIFICATE (PEM):** O conteúdo do certificado"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:48
msgid "**PRIVATE KEY (PEM):** The private key content"
msgstr "**PRIVATE KEY (PEM):** O conteúdo da chave privada"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:49
msgid "**CERTIFICATE CHAIN (PEM):** Intermediate and root CA certificates"
msgstr "**CERTIFICATE CHAIN (PEM):** Certificados intermediários e da CA raiz"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:51
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:53
msgid ""
"|morpheus| uploads the certificate to the NSX-T Manager and stores the "
"external reference for ongoing management."
msgstr "O |morpheus| envia o certificado ao NSX-T Manager e armazena a referência externa para gerenciamento contínuo."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:56
msgid "Viewing NSX-T Certificates"
msgstr "Visualizando Certificados NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:58
msgid ""
"Certificates synced from NSX-T integrations appear in the certificate "
"list with their NSX-T association visible. Details include:"
msgstr "Certificados sincronizados a partir de integrações NSX-T aparecem na lista de certificados com sua associação NSX-T visível. Os detalhes incluem:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:60
msgid "NSX-T Manager reference ID"
msgstr "ID de referência do NSX-T Manager"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:61
msgid "Certificate purpose (e.g., API, Cluster Communication)"
msgstr "Finalidade do certificado (por exemplo, API, Cluster Communication)"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:62
msgid "Expiration status"
msgstr "Status de expiração"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:63
msgid "Associated NSX-T services"
msgstr "Serviços NSX-T associados"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:66
msgid "Replacing NSX-T Certificates"
msgstr "Substituindo Certificados NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:68
msgid "To replace an expiring certificate on an NSX-T Manager:"
msgstr "Para substituir um certificado que está expirando em um NSX-T Manager:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:70
msgid "Upload the new certificate to |morpheus| as described above"
msgstr "Envie o novo certificado ao |morpheus| conforme descrito acima"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:71
msgid "Associate the new certificate with the same NSX-T service"
msgstr "Associe o novo certificado ao mesmo serviço NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:72
msgid "|morpheus| coordinates the replacement with the NSX-T Manager API"
msgstr "O |morpheus| coordena a substituição com a API do NSX-T Manager"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:73
msgid "Verify the NSX-T Manager is using the new certificate"
msgstr "Verifique se o NSX-T Manager está usando o novo certificado"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:75
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Alerta"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:75
msgid ""
"Replacing certificates on NSX-T management and cluster services requires "
"careful planning. Incorrect certificate replacement can disrupt NSX-T "
"operations. Always verify certificate compatibility in a test environment"
" first."
msgstr "Substituir certificados em serviços de gerenciamento e de cluster do NSX-T exige planejamento cuidadoso. A substituição incorreta de certificados pode interromper as operações do NSX-T. Sempre verifique a compatibilidade do certificado em um ambiente de teste primeiro."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:78
msgid "Certificate Synchronization"
msgstr "Sincronização de Certificados"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:80
msgid ""
"|morpheus| periodically synchronizes certificate data from NSX-T "
"integrations:"
msgstr "O |morpheus| sincroniza periodicamente os dados de certificados a partir de integrações NSX-T:"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:82
msgid "Existing certificates on NSX-T are discovered and displayed in |morpheus|"
msgstr "Certificados existentes no NSX-T são descobertos e exibidos no |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:83
msgid "Certificate expiration dates are tracked"
msgstr "As datas de expiração dos certificados são rastreadas"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:84
msgid "Status changes (e.g., revocation) are reflected in the |morpheus| UI"
msgstr "Mudanças de status (por exemplo, revogação) são refletidas na UI |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:86
msgid ""
"To force a synchronization, refresh the NSX-T integration from "
"Infrastructure > Network > Integrations."
msgstr "Para forçar uma sincronização, atualize a integração NSX-T em Infrastructure > Network > Integrations."

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:89
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solução de Problemas"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:91
msgid "**Certificate upload fails:**"
msgstr "**Falha no envio do certificado:**"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:93
msgid "Verify the certificate and key are in valid PEM format"
msgstr "Verifique se o certificado e a chave estão em formato PEM válido"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:94
msgid "Ensure the private key matches the certificate (modulus check)"
msgstr "Garanta que a chave privada corresponda ao certificado (verificação de módulo)"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:95
msgid "Confirm NSX-T API connectivity from the |morpheus| appliance"
msgstr "Confirme a conectividade da API NSX-T a partir do appliance |morpheus|"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:97
msgid "**Certificate not appearing on NSX-T:**"
msgstr "**Certificado não aparece no NSX-T:**"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:99
msgid "Check the |morpheus| integration status for the NSX-T instance"
msgstr "Verifique o status da integração |morpheus| para a instância NSX-T"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:100
msgid "Review the |morpheus| activity log for API errors"
msgstr "Revise o log de atividade |morpheus| em busca de erros de API"

#: ../../infrastructure/certificates/nsxt_certificates.rst:101
msgid "Verify NSX-T API user has certificate management permissions"
msgstr "Verifique se o usuário da API NSX-T tem permissões de gerenciamento de certificados"

